<p>For Hampton Cove homeowners, there are really only two options: clean gutters multiple times a year (or pay someone to do it), or install gutter guards that keep debris out automatically. Given the cost of repeated cleanings and the risk of water damage to expensive homes, guards are often the smarter investment.</p>

