{% set service_explanation %}
<p>Gutter guards are protective covers that fit over or inside your gutters, blocking debris while allowing water to enter. Different types work better for different debris challenges.</p>

<p>Micro-mesh guards use fine screens that block even pine needles. Screen guards handle larger leaves effectively. Solid covers use surface tension to pull water in while debris slides off. We'll assess your specific trees and debris patterns, then recommend the best solution for your Hampton Cove home.</p>
{% endset %}

